'' copy_to AND A VENDOR PACKAGE (tiko-vendor RFC-0002 V13): 'tiko build' copies the program into
'' dist/ and, with it, the DLL the link step put beside the artefact -- reported as a
'' runtime-lib event -- so the copy in dist/ starts.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TIKO_PKG=build/.vct/pkg
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.vct/mc
'' CLEAN: build/.vct
'' COPY: tests/modules/src/vlink/pkg => build/.vct/pkg
'' STEP: -target windows-x86_64 -dll tests/modules/src/vlink/libsrc/alpha_dynamic.tiko -o build/.vct/pkg/vendor/alpha/lib/alpha_windows_x86_64.dll
'' COPY: tests/modules/src/vlink/proj => build/.vct/proj
'' ARGS: build -target windows-x86_64 --manifest build/.vct/proj --message-format json
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: {"event":"runtime-lib","path":"build/.vct/proj/out/debug/alpha_windows_x86_64.dll"}
'' EXPECT-OUT: {"event":"copy","target":"app","from":"build/.vct/proj/out/debug/alpha_windows_x86_64.dll","path":"build/.vct/proj/dist/alpha_windows_x86_64.dll","copied":true}
'' EXPECT-FILE: build/.vct/proj/dist/app.exe
'' EXPECT-FILE: build/.vct/proj/dist/alpha_windows_x86_64.dll
'' RUN: build/.vct/proj/dist/app.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2             alpha header: dynamic
